!Name: p90forwrake-1
!C A period 90 c/3 forward rake.
!C The exhaust from a period 45 puffer is perturbed by a series of period 3
!C spaceships to form a period 90 forwards rake.  The final glider is formed
!C by a Herschel reaction.  This is an improvement on a previous version
!C of the rake.
!C David I. Bell, August 2002
!Source: jslife-moving
!
